==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 26 seconds<sup>780f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**5 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to bring [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]], [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] and [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] Cats. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fried Shrimp Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sadako Cat]] are some good examples. Fried Shrimp or Sadako should work just fine for the Shy Boy, and bringing an [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attacker]] that outranges Rain D. (e.g. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]]) is also recommended.

